IT06
Description:
-Create a batch quality-control inspection program.
-Generate a batch of 10 random parts.
-Use a loop to inspect each part.
-Apply if/else conditions to classify each part.
-Create two counter variables:
  - Accepted parts
  - Rejected parts
-Update the respective counters after each inspection.
-Display the final batch report:
- Total parts inspected: 10
- Number of accepted parts
- Number of rejected parts
-Ensure the total accepted and rejected parts equals 10.
