IT08
Description:
-Create a quality inspection program for manufactured parts.
-Use a random or user-input value as the part diameter.
-Define the minimum and maximum acceptable diameter.
-Use an if/else condition to check the diameter.
-Display ACCEPT if the diameter is within the specified limits.
-Display REJECT if the diameter is outside the limits.
-Simulate the inspection process using Scratch blocks.
